# Trace query — fragmented state churn window stats
#
# Coverage target: window_stats should expose state_churn as a consumable
# runtime observation with per-state cumulative time, fragment/switch counts,
# max/p95 segment, and next-step guidance for fragmented frame windows.
ID="trace_query_state_churn_window_stats"
NAME="trace query — state_churn window stats"
QUESTION="请优先使用 trace_query 的 window_stats 能力分析 11.0s 到 11.008s 内 app-20 的碎片化调度状态。这个窗口没有单个很长的 runnable/sleep/D/running 片段，请输出 state_churn 的 dominant_state、running/runnable/sleep/d_state/io_wait 累计、fragments、switches、max_segment、p95_segment，并说明下一步应该如何往下查主因。"
HTRACE='# tracer: nop
#           TASK-PID   CPU#    TIMESTAMP  FUNCTION
        app-20   (   20) [001] .... 11.000000: sched_switch: prev_comm=idle/1 prev_pid=0 prev_prio=120 prev_state=R ==> next_comm=app next_pid=20 next_prio=53
